{"unit_id":"ChenXu233__dsh-perf-patch#caveat-1","repo":"ChenXu233/dsh-perf-patch","commit":"b9ed37b7dc5e484214be6edd67204ac22d84fb15","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"缓存命中时会向不同调用方共享 schema 对象；代码按引用保存并原样返回结果，因此调用方应只读这些对象，避免修改影响其他读取者。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:52-60","lib/index.js:72-80"]}
